# Medical Coding Specialist – Portfolio Website

## Project Overview
A professional and responsive portfolio website for Dr. Kalsoom Shahzad, a Medical Coding and Prior Authorization Specialist.

The website highlights professional experience, medical coding expertise, healthcare services, educational background, and contact information.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5 – Website structure
- CSS3 – Styling and responsive design
- JavaScript – Interactive functionality

## Features

- **Professional Home Section:** Introduction and professional profile.
- **About Section:** Read More / Read Less functionality.
- **Core Expertise:** Filterable expertise cards.
- **Services & Rates:** Interactive service selection and automatic price calculation.
- **Professional Experience:** Experience table with hover highlighting.
- **Education Section:** Academic qualifications.
- **Contact Form:** User input validation and success messages.
- **Discount Calculator:** Student and senior discount eligibility based on birth year.
- **Dark / Light Mode:** Theme toggle functionality.
- **Live Status Banner:** Displays open or closed status based on the current time.
- **Character Counter:** Tracks remaining characters in the special request field.

