## How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Make sure all four project files are in the same folder.
4. Open `index.html` in your browser.

## Project Purpose

This project demonstrates practical frontend web development skills, including webpage structuring, styling, DOM manipulation, event handling, form validation, and interactive user interface development.

